# Round 79 (b,c): fractional bounds truncated ((long)2.5 ran 2
# iterations where the VM's i < 2.5 runs 3) and NEGATIVE bounds
# force-assigned the counter to the bound (-3) where the VM never
# enters and leaves it at 0. The hoist is now ceil-and-clamp, which
# matches the VM's 0-base/step-1 iteration count and final counter
# for every bound sign and fraction.
b is buffer of 10
n is 2.5
i is 0
loop while i < n:
    b[i] is 1
    i is i + 1
print of i
print of b[2]
